Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did your\Nheart stop beating, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.14,0:00:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe my\Nfather is actually dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.26,0:00:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he'll be okay if\NI can get his stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can explain these new abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What you have is called a stand power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got questions, Jolene Cujoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.83,0:00:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Ermes has a stand too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And about the discs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it sounds crazy, but\NI'm telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.10,0:00:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,When Ermes put the memory disc back into\NMcQueen, he suddenly came back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:00:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he regenerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.78,0:01:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can somehow retrieve\Nthose discs, Jolene,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.34,0:01:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,then I have complete faith\Nyour father will surely...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, what'd you do with\Nthe discs that were in that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm keeping them safe with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If Ermes were to take them into her cell,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the guards would definitely\Nfind them during the body check.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.64,0:01:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be giving the\Nstand disc back to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll return the disc with his\Nmemories after some time passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,McQueen's memory disk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.42,0:01:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,On this CD, there are memories that can\Ngive me some idea of who's behind Palesnake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.54,0:01:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe, even memories about\Nthe disks from my old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:01:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:01:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.20,0:02:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me with the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.70,0:02:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's minding my business doing my job?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.94,0:02:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All I did was touch the tire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.18,0:02:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.16,0:02:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.60,0:02:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your ass in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta close the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up and help me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us your all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.22,0:02:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pulling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.94,0:02:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull harder or we're\Nboth gonna die in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.58,0:02:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, those ain't my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who wasn't pulling\Nhard enough was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.48,0:02:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what's the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.80,0:03:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry to it, that's\NRadio of the needle and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get raised and move. It's\Nall been around. We won't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch it. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.62,0:03:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My little survival day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from No water! I!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna fade. Let's start! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3. Can we find a way?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,don't stop beating, don't\Nstop beating, I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,who were working on the farm\Nsuddenly disappeared without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, that is absolutely awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unthinkable that these two\Ninmates were able to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Could they have fallen into a marshland\Nand drowned or been bitten by a snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.46,0:05:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, we have to do everything\Nwe can to find those two right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you considering\Nthe possibility that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.28,0:05:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,an alligator could have\Nhad them for breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Might have been a female one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it, which one of\Nyou said that nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, I did do such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My diet is criminal-free, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, on to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.04,0:05:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're putting together a\Nsearch party and I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,needing a slight few of\Nyou ladies to do the deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not receive compensation, nor will\Nany time be docked from your sentences.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm merely requesting you help us\Nout of the kindness of your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Any volunteers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.72,0:05:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Jolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:06:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You literally just got out of solitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to tire\Nyourself out even more?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.66,0:06:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe because you're\Nnot going to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.02,0:06:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.50,0:06:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Five of you should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.98,0:06:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard, I'll leave the precautions to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to prevent any attempts at\Nescaping, we've got these nifty bracelets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All inmates going to\Nthe farm must wear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We call them like a virgins, but\Nthey're also known as invisible bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only going to say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hit these with any type of force,\Ntry taking them off or even destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They will explode immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I have the base unit on my wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go any more than 50\Nmeters away, they'll detonate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,it's going to be really hard to wipe\Nyour ass if you don't have a wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.74,0:07:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you five, show me some hustle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.42,0:07:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty meters, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have to run to keep up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.52,0:07:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait just a second! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, from here we'll split up\Nand search in every direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That grassy thicket you\Nsee over there is a marsh,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's chock-full of alligators,\Nso watch where you're trekking!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Safe to say it's not in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.46,0:07:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you volunteer for\Nthis scavenger hunt, Jolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I am glad you decided to come\Nalong, I've got a few questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'd like some answers about\Nthis whole disc situation and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.48,0:07:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Importantly, this pale snake guy I've\Nheard so much about before that answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This did you see what was on that disc\Nthe one from the inmate named McQueen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh yeah I gave it a look over but\Nmessing with that thing made me feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Horrible whenever I touched it this\Nawful smell assaulted my senses so you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't notice it then huh if you take\Na closer look at the footage that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Recorded you'll see there's a clue that\Ncould reveal Palesnake's intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,McCree, my child, this disc is perfect for
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you it'll suit you well it shall be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please now, take this\NStand ability and prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.10,0:08:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got more of these stockpiled\Nin the farm tractor's tire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There had to be at least two dozen\Nmore discs hidden away in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand what he's trying to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.12,0:08:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably been robbing Stand users,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,taking their memories and abilities\Nfor his personal collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,With the amount of discs\Nthat he's gathered together,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.74,0:09:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,he'd need to make sure other inmates\Nand guards couldn't discover them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,hence the secluded hiding spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No one would ever check a tire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad's might be there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The discs with Star\NPlatinum and his memories
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,have got to be hidden away with the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So the whole reason you're doing\Nthis is to find your dad's?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's about all I\Nknow regarding this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go look for that tractor
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're looking for a tractor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing as we're on a farm, there\Nare probably gonna be a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That storehouse Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.74,0:09:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You two ladies sure look like you're\Nhaving a grand old time over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:10:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Nout here for, a picnic?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the chitchat and get to search it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, we were just about to\Ncheck that building over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who made us\Nchase you like dogs earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say it's you who's having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.56,0:10:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it! You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say something just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, not particularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only given my\Nsolemn vow to run around
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,this farm and search\Nlike a good little dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, she rubs me the wrong way. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.28,0:10:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like an alligator's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you\Nare looking down on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.82,0:10:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one in charge here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.98,0:10:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.89,0:10:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a complete accident, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a coincidence that my baton was\Nswinging at the same spot as your wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.66,0:10:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it making this sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't mean what I\Nthink it does, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't actually hit\Nthat thing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw what happened, it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Blame yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:10:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this thing ain't gonna\Ngo on for real, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.52,0:11:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, real funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.94,0:11:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now just make it stop, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey now, don't go\Nwaving that thing over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.50,0:11:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were to explode near me, well,\Nthat'd be bad news for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, I'm sorry for what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, be careful, Missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.98,0:11:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Get any closer to me and\Nwe're gonna have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make this damn noise go\Naway before my wrist goes slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That ought to cheat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.48,0:11:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're falling right on\Ntop of some alligator shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.96,0:11:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stopped beeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, stop panicking, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That fall could have been real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.80,0:11:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see that beeping\Nwas just there to warn you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.32,0:11:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't in any\Ndanger, right, Mr. Guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.56,0:11:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece of shit, Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So that stand was yours, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd we even look here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.48,0:12:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only a tractor and\Nbags of flour everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in even checking inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If they could be found here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,they wouldn't have needed a stupid\Nsearch party in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, that's gotta be it, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.86,0:12:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same shape as the tractor\Nwe saw from the discs recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Same number, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.40,0:12:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's got the same vehicle number.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.84,0:12:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Four, just like the disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.42,0:12:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They should be in that tire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.14,0:12:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can remove it, we'll\Nfind the discs inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now be moving our\Nsearch to the marshland!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:13:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible that our\Ntwo missing convicts
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,were attacked by gators\Nor drowned in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get swimming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly do you think\Nis getting in that water?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it ain't gonna be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He can ride that on land and water?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If we step foot in that marsh,\Nwe're just asking for diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.26,0:13:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance to remove that tire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene, you feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Something real strange is going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, this is definitely bizarre. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.98,0:13:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,if we don't remove the tire right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the guard will keep moving\Nfarther away from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember what the\Nchief said when we started?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,he mentioned five people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.50,0:13:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we left, he definitely\Nsaid five of you should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But now there are six of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.50,0:13:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene, what the hell\Ndo you think is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you include the two of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There are six of us here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:14:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure when we took off\Nearlier, there were only five.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I never took a good look\Nat the other girls' faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, do you see the same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so focused on running.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, everyone is wearing a handcuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.98,0:14:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Were there always six of us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, from the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, what'd you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So you noticed it too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're thinking that when\Nwe all first started,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,there were only five of us, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea when and who came in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really, and I might just be mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it doesn't really\Nmatter how many there are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can vouch for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.96,0:14:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She was with me from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.22,0:14:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name is Atro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.70,0:14:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I always see her getting bullied.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You volunteered for this search\Nbecause your bullies didn't come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.44,0:14:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have no\Nidea who you are. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.99,0:14:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is my handcuff beeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.74,0:14:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine is, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.72,0:15:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everyone's cuff is beeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.56,0:15:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The motorbike went more\Nthan 50 meters away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.82,0:15:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The guard isn't there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The motorbike is covered in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.62,0:15:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.64,0:15:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know why all\Nthe cuffs keep beeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be because the\Nguard's body is moving
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,farther and farther\Naway from where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.82,0:15:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he have fallen into the\Nwater and is being washed away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just find that stupid prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.54,0:15:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever he is, he's\Nmore than 50 meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.64,0:15:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.38,0:15:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.58,0:15:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine is getting really fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.62,0:15:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be the additional\Nperson decided to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:16:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because we got too close to those\Ndiscs hidden away in the storehouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.68,0:16:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look 50 meters in the opposite\Ndirection from the girl that blew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get to the guard, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.02,0:16:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're close to him, this beeping\Nwill stop and we won't explode too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch your back, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.34,0:16:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt the enemy has got to be one of\Nthose three girls and an enraged psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.64,0:16:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Personally, I already know\Nwho I'm suspicious of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it's that chick with the undercut.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, the girl who blew up did\Nsay she didn't know who she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be her, I'm telling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She used her stand to take out the guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.24,0:16:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And before she kills us,\Nwe gotta get the bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.68,0:16:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's say our culprit\Nis who you think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.24,0:16:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If that were the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't that mean she would\Nhave been guarding the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.62,0:16:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,discs in that storehouse\Nsince before we showed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.24,0:16:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess that's just about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.54,0:16:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no way a prisoner\Ncan guard something 24-7.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Joanne, stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.07,0:17:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.99,0:17:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay the hell away from the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something in this bucket!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, hey, did you\Nreally see something? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.38,0:17:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, I won't be going\Nin this marsh ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.92,0:17:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay close, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing we need is to\Nget separated from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.24,0:17:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially since we have\Nno idea who the enemy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.88,0:17:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And we've still got these\Ntroublesome handcuffs to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.84,0:17:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to take the\Ndiscs from the storehouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to make sure we\Nstay within 50 meters of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the guard's body and the\Nthree other prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What the shit was in that bucket?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:17:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It grabbed my face out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of demented flea?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It split in two!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, now there's four of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It was stupid to think that there\Nwasn't anything in the bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If i'd taken a second\Nto look more carefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,i'd have seen that there were\Ncountless little bastards?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's swimming in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.62,0:18:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.40,0:18:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This water is a death trap and it's\Ngetting deadlier by the second!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but the\Nstand multiplies in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't catch up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all part of the stand's plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.82,0:19:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, she's walking on woven threads?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you're using that much thread,\Ndoesn't that mean you're losing body mass?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,every time you take a step over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, just get out of the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.78,0:19:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Save yourself, I can take care of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Ura!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It definitely feels impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Good freaking grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't taken out all of that thread\Nfrom my body, I'd be dead right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Her guts are completely hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she let that thing hit her\Nso she could grab it's hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.92,0:20:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, we have to hurry\Nand get out of the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.40,0:20:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stand up just yet, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That parasitic fuck is really just a\Nbunch of tiny stands clustered together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They were hiding in the\Nwater of the bucket I kicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then when I turned around,\Nthey dragged me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.56,0:20:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm asking you not to stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.78,0:20:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta grab onto it under the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The thread that I'm releasing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.32,0:20:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.50,0:20:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Powerful too, but the speed's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As the stand moves farther away from its\Nuser, it should become weaker and slower!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.19,0:20:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.72,0:20:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave our pursuer here a stigma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.20,0:21:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I managed to slap one on it\Nwhen I was caught in its arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what my stand can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.56,0:21:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rip it off now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Away from the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.54,0:21:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not coming onto land.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.22,0:21:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought, it can only attack when\Nits prey is in the water with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.48,0:21:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is prisoner number FE-32125!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The guard got into an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody please just hurry up and help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.22,0:21:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going\Non with the two of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It almost looked as though you were\Nrunning on top of the water earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.58,0:21:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.90,0:21:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to die, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:21:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All three of you, get away from the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.46,0:22:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go trying to do anything funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.64,0:22:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy here is one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.94,0:22:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to grab the\Ndiscs in the storehouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.76,0:22:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,first we have to take\Ncare of the stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.76,0:22:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.50,0:22:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.70,0:22:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.04,0:23:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering About my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.98,0:23:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,about Out all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.66,0:23:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.78,0:23:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,a distant dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.48,0:23:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,dreaming for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From today
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.14,0:24:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.14,0:24:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
